How It Works
1. The teacher logs in and generates a QR code for an attendance session.
2. The student logs in and opens the QR scanner.
3. The student scans the teacher's QR code.
4. The system records the attendance in the database.
5. Teachers and students can view attendance records through their dashboards.

Project Purpose
The purpose of this project is to simplify attendance management, reduce manual work, and provide a convenient way to maintain attendance records.

